1
00:00:01,955 --> 00:00:04,264
Siege Command Simulator is created by

2
00:00:04,266 --> 00:00:07,594
Jim Tze Lau using Unity and VoltanicXR.

3
00:00:08,605 --> 00:00:10,355
In this game, you command troops

4
00:00:10,355 --> 00:00:12,595
to siege down an enemy city.

5
00:00:12,596 --> 00:00:14,515
You'll command your troops by drawing

6
00:00:14,516 --> 00:00:16,355
a line to tell them where to go.

7
00:00:16,356 --> 00:00:18,355
In the CAVE environment,

8
00:00:18,356 --> 00:00:19,475
this is as easy as

9
00:00:19,476 --> 00:00:20,565
pointing and dragging.

10
00:00:21,285 --> 00:00:23,434
Troops automatically fight with enemy

11
00:00:23,435 --> 00:00:25,195
troops when they are within range,

12
00:00:25,196 --> 00:00:26,635
and retreat automatically

13
00:00:26,636 --> 00:00:27,195
when they are

14
00:00:27,196 --> 00:00:28,195
defeated.

15
00:00:28,385 --> 00:00:30,214
If they retreat successfully,

16
00:00:30,216 --> 00:00:32,054
they will regroup at camp.

17
00:00:32,055 --> 00:00:34,054
If they are cut off during retreat,

18
00:00:34,055 --> 00:00:35,945
they are eliminated permanently.

19
00:00:37,085 --> 00:00:39,314
Demo mode is recommended for beginners

20
00:00:39,315 --> 00:00:41,314
because in the full mode units

21
00:00:41,315 --> 00:00:42,994
move faster and there are more

22
00:00:42,995 --> 00:00:43,994
enemy troops.

23
00:00:45,185 --> 00:00:46,774
Every once in a while, the

24
00:00:46,775 --> 00:00:48,664
enemy will shut arrows at you.

25
00:00:49,604 --> 00:00:51,755
You must dodge these arrows physically

26
00:00:51,756 --> 00:00:53,405
in the CAVE by moving around.

27
00:00:54,725 --> 00:00:56,875
If you only want to dodge the arrows,

28
00:00:56,875 --> 00:00:58,875
you can try out the timed challenge,

29
00:00:58,875 --> 00:00:59,515
where you have three

30
00:00:59,515 --> 00:01:00,475
hit points and need to

31
00:01:00,475 --> 00:01:01,884
survive for thirty seconds.

32
00:01:02,884 --> 00:01:05,194
Or endless survival, where you only

33
00:01:05,195 --> 00:01:06,715
have one hit point and need to

34
00:01:06,716 --> 00:01:08,204
survive for as long as you can.

35
00:01:09,084 --> 00:01:10,995
There is also a multiplayer mode,

36
00:01:10,996 --> 00:01:13,314
where one player plays in the DASE

37
00:01:13,316 --> 00:01:15,075
CAVE as the attacker trying to

38
00:01:15,076 --> 00:01:17,155
protect the cannons, and another

39
00:01:17,156 --> 00:01:19,394
player plays in the LED CAVE as

40
00:01:19,396 --> 00:01:21,075
the defender trying to destroy the

41
00:01:21,076 --> 00:01:22,075
cannons.
